POM -> project object model
it contains configuration (dependencies, build directory, source directory, test directory, plugin, goals)

Elements of maven pom.xml
1. project -> root element
2. model version -> sub element
3. groupid -> sub element -> specifies id of project group
4. artifactid -> specifies the id for artifact ex:- war, jar, source || uniqueid is storedin artifact 
5. version -> it specifies version of artifact under given group 

Additional elements:
1. packaging
2. name 
3. description
4. url 
5. dependencies
6. scope -> defines scope of maven project/dependency -> compile provided runtime test system